/tmp/claude-1007/-home-yixunhu-codespace-FLAC/1630c6fe-5d3e-42b4-94ec-1b6d3bcb0e4e/scratchpad/r3a/fresh_clone_merged/worklog/worklog_yixun/exp_11_fa_orbit_claude/fa_orbit_codex_chunk_kit_review.md:4528:worklog/worklog_yixun/exp_11_fa_orbit_claude/commits_fa_orbit.md:50:| 41 | `b23fccd` | GO-check NO-GO closure. **ASSETS (the crasher):** `fa_orbit_measure_worktree.sh` links `AcousticRooms` and `weights` into every pinned worktree at the main tree's own targets — a fresh worktree holds only TRACKED files, so the eval's relative `AcousticRooms` / `weights/AGREE/AGREE_fullAR.pt` did not exist and a pinned screen would have died at startup; the screen now stats each required asset before spending a slot. **LIFECYCLE:** fixed-count pruning (which could delete a QUEUED job's tree) is replaced by LEASES — `.leases/<jobid>` written under an `flock` before `sbatch` returns and promoted to the real id, validated by the job at start, released by a trap at exit; a tree is prunable only with zero live leases (stale ids double-checked against `squeue`) and never the tree being handed out. New `fa_orbit_screen_submit.sh` makes pin+lease+submit atomic. **IMMUTABLE LAUNCH BINDING:** the launch manifest lives under gitignored outputs and is mutable, so it is now bound to a committed `arm_launch_registry.json` by sha256 plus job, mode INITIAL, launch uuid, commit, rung, max_steps, config/VAE/P0 hashes, save-dir and seed 42 — the seed used to be printed, not checked. **TABLE:** the two-K gate is transactional (aborts without writing; `--allow-partial-exp11` still renders WITHHELD, never numbers), `build_header()` is actually called by `main()` so the LABEL-MIGRATION-DEFERRED note reaches the file, and `--repo-root` resolves evidence/validator/output against the MAIN tree from any cwd. Also: MEASURE_ROOT must be a detached, managed worktree of THIS repo under `.measure_worktrees/`, and the sidecar records a repo-relative model-config path. |
